OL,3,GNEWSAA31 weekend closure for
OL,4,Aresurfacing work
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being urged to plan ahead
OL,7,Fas the A31 will shut for the weekend
OL,8,Ffor resurfacing.
OL,10,FThe work will see a stretch of about
OL,11,Feight miles (13km) closed both ways
OL,12,Fbetween Bere Regis and Sturminster
OL,13,FMarshall.
OL,15,FThe full closure will be in place
OL,16,Fbetween the Bere Regis roundabout and
OL,17,Fthe Roundhouse roundabout with a
OL,18,Fdiversion of about 12 miles (20km) from
OL,19,FFriday at 21:00 BST through until
OL,20,FMonday at 06:00.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
